#   ECU2 SW-C2 prints received value and rejects > 250 kph (never fires here).
# Build: bash configure.sh && make in both ecu1 and ecu2 (per upstream README).
# Run: hako-master 100 200 / two hako-proxy terminals / hako-cmd start (75 s).
