#   - Windows CRLF checkout normalized to LF inside container
#   - symlink /workspaces/hakoniwa-ecu-multiplay -> work copy (proxy JSON pins that path)
# Observation: ECU2's first cycle reads the COM init value 0 kph (read-before-first-write),
#   then tracks ECU1 with a one-cycle lag (ECU1 61..210, ECU2 0,61..209); all values
#   plausible, 0 rejections. Max observed 210 < 250: wrap point not reached in 75 s.
# Acceptance: ATK2 banner on both ECUs; 150 cyclic transmissions per side; value
#   streams match with one-cycle lag; no plausibility rejection.
